{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は撮影がありましたぁ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別のスタジオに小さい子供が沢山いたぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ可愛かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影の後、レッスンがありました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はユッキーナもいたから皆でワチャワチャと楽しかった〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、さゆにゃんとめっちゃ絡んだけど何話したかわすれちゃった〜笑笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみとまあや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、前髪を変えたそうで、前髪をめっちゃアピールしてきます〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変わらず仲良しなので時々お泊まりに来てくれます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近どんな髪型がいいのか悩み中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにかご意見ありましたら\n教えてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまぁ〜この前、お互いの顔を使ってメイクをしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったねぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アハハ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の質問、皆からのコメントで、おもわず吹き出して大笑いしちゃった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもケガしないように..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互い気を付けよう...(￣▽￣;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもブログを読んでくれてありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントは毎回笑ったり時には感動してウルウル涙したり、スキって書いてあってビックリドキドキ心臓が騒いだりしちゃいます..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみに読んでます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書くのに時間かかると思うけど書いてくれて本当に嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントにはどれくらい時間がかかりますか〜？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからこの前せいらりんを突然誘って縄跳びしました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後せいらりんのおうちに行って2人で映画をみました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪\nせいらりんは一緒にいると元気が出てきて楽しいよ♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また遊びにいきたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では今せっちゃんとMAILしてるからまたねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/21/5886445/0015.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}